*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0015
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-04-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 672
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0015.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PEN0015C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 WS-AST             PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 L-CG               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM SUSPEND-CHECK
    PERFORM REFER-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "WS-AST=" WS-AST
    DISPLAY "L-CG=" L-CG
    STOP RUN.
SUSPEND-CHECK.
    *> REPEAT LATE PAYER SUSPENSION
    IF WS-LCNT >= 5
       AND D-PD > 30
        MOVE 'S' TO WS-AST
        ADD 100 TO L-CG
    END-IF.
REFER-COLLECTIONS.
    *> COLLECTIONS REFERRAL
    IF D-PD > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO WS-AST
    END-IF.
